  {
    "source_id": "oysroma-road-charter",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "content": "Oyo State Road Maintenance Agency (OYSROMA) Public Infrastructure Charter: Roads across Ibadan (including Elebu, Ring Road, Dugbe, Iwo Road, and Sango) damaged by erosion, heavy rainfall, or heavy vehicle traffic are rehabilitated under the state rapid intervention framework. When citizens report potholes or road cave-ins, field engineers conduct inspection within 48 to 72 hours. Emergency patches and asphalt grading are scheduled to prevent fatal vehicular accidents.",
