    "chunk_index": 1,
    "content": "IBEDC Prepaid Meter Upgrade and Fault Resolution: Customers experiencing token rejection, burnt meter terminals, or phase loss must report to the nearest business hub. Faulty prepaid meters undergo technical evaluation within 5 working days. Where a meter is declared obsolete or damaged through network surge, replacement is processed under the National Mass Metering Programme guidelines. Energy theft and meter bypass carry severe penalties.",
