    "source_id": "oyo-drainage-flooding-policy",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "content": "Oyo State Ministry of Environment Flood Alert and Waste Management Regulations: To prevent urban flooding in flood-prone LGAs (Ibadan North, Ibadan North-East, Ido, and Oluyole), primary rivers such as Ogunpa, Kudeti, and Ona are dredged annually before torrential rainy seasons. Dumping solid waste into gutters, stream channels, and drainage culverts is strictly illegal under the Oyo State Environmental Sanitation Law and attracts heavy fines or community service. Communities are urged to report clogged culverts and illegal dumpsites for immediate clearance.",
